# Normalize line endings in the repository to LF.
#
# Why: with core.autocrlf=true and no attributes, the working copy is CRLF while the
# index is LF. Tools that emit LF (stylua) then report a whole-file diff for every file,
# which makes `stylua --check` useless as a gate. Committed content stays LF, and
# stylua.toml sets line_endings = "Auto" so local checks do not fight the checkout.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.rbxlx binary
*.rbxl binary
*.rbxm binary
